{"unit_id":"FeWOO__DeepSeek-meme#card-zh","repo":"FeWOO/DeepSeek-meme","commit":"26b3a5a83ec3e48e40add58de7d019db088894cf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek Meme 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的本地表情包插件，在聊天输入区加入表情按钮和贴纸面板，并提供模型可调用的 send_sticker 工具。用户可以浏览默认与社区贴纸包，创建自己的表情包，上传 PNG、JPEG、WebP 或 GIF 图片，编辑名称、含义和标签，也可以移动或删除贴纸；点击贴纸会作为图片消息发送，模型则可查询目录并选择表情回复。它适合希望在 DSH 对话中用图片表达反应、管理个人贴纸库并让模型理解贴纸含义的用户。配置可将数据目录设为自定义位置，默认保存在 DSH_HOME 下的 memes 目录；插件代码未要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:733-736","index.js:850-900","index.js:1044-1051","client.js:878-908"]}
{"unit_id":"FeWOO__DeepSeek-meme#card-en","repo":"FeWOO/DeepSeek-meme","commit":"26b3a5a83ec3e48e40add58de7d019db088894cf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DeepSeek Meme adds a sticker picker to DSH web chat and a send_sticker tool for the model. Users can browse bundled packs, create packs, upload images, edit sticker meanings, and send stickers as image messages. The local library defaults to DSH_HOME/memes or ~/.dsh/memes; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:733-736","index.js:850-900","index.js:1044-1051","client.js:878-908"]}
